  "reason": "Existing evidence shows RNA-only models with scvi_n200 and multiprofile settings achieve high accuracy (0.65), but the role of image modalities remains untested. This experiment tests image-only models with resnet50 encoder to isolate the impact of image data. It clarifies whether image modality contributes meaningfully, balancing exploration of new modalities against exploitation of current RNA-only performance. The choice avoids combining multiple changes and directly addresses uncertainty about image data's utility."
